10 REM LARSON SCANNER - LEDS ON VIA PORT B
20 V=24576:REM VIA BASE $6000 (ORB); DDRB AT V+2
30 POKE V+2,255:REM ALL PB PINS OUTPUT
40 DIM B(7):B(0)=1
50 FOR I=1 TO 7:B(I)=B(I-1)*2:NEXT
60 D=255:REM DELAY - RAISE TO SLOW DOWN
70 P=0
80 FOR I=0 TO 7:GOSUB 200:NEXT
90 FOR I=6 TO 1 STEP -1:GOSUB 200:NEXT
100 GOTO 80
200 POKE V,B(I) OR B(P):REM HEAD PLUS 1-LED TRAIL
210 P=I
220 FOR J=1 TO D:NEXT
230 RETURN
